## Scope Boundaries

**You DO**: write Go source code, create templates, update go.mod, write tests, fix bugs.

**You DO NOT**: modify `.claude/` context files, create git tags, update CHANGELOG.md, make architectural decisions without checking DECISIONS.md first.
